| `test_no_tool_call[True-<p>hello]` | FAIL (content `None`) | pass |
| `test_no_tool_call[True-<b>bold</b>]` | FAIL (content `None`) | pass |
| `test_no_tool_call[True-<function> is an HTML-like tag...]` | FAIL (content `None`) | pass |
| olmo3 + pythonic + llama4-pythonic suites | 3 failed, 63 passed | 66 passed |

